ey can no longer trust their senses and tell the difference between reality and a hallucination.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/635200/extras/5a13f881bf8d3267f6fe8282057756ab.poster.avif?t=1748493906\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/635200/extras/5a13f881bf8d3267f6fe8282057756ab.webm?t=1748493906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
